---
// Hero setting is specified in absolute values at the mobile baseline and
// scaled proportionally with clamp() at larger viewports. The mobile values
// below are exactly as briefed; see the note on --hero-nav-clearance.
---

<section id="hero" class="hero relative overflow-hidden bg-ink text-center">
  <!-- Ground: azure accent lifted out of the dark base. Decorative only. -->
  <div class="hero-wash absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="relative max-w-2xl mx-auto flex flex-col items-center">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-on-ink hero-eyebrow" data-reveal>For online fitness coaches</p>

    <h1 class="hero-headline text-white" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:70ms">
      Add clients.<br />Not <span class="text-white">hours</span>.
    </h1>

    <p class="hero-subhead" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:140ms">
      Programs, workouts, check-ins, client chat. Your AI runs the everyday in your
      voice, built from one conversation. No content library required.
    </p>

    <div
      class="w-full max-w-md hero-bubble bg-surface-1/85 backdrop-blur-md border border-hairline-dark rounded-[22px] p-5 shadow-2xl text-left"
      data-reveal
      style="--reveal-delay:210ms"
    >
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pb-4 mb-4 border-b border-hairline-dark">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-azure-deep flex items-center justify-center font-display text-white text-base shrink-0">
          S
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-body font-bold text-sm text-text leading-tight">Sarah&rsquo;s AI</p>
          <p class="font-label text-xs text-text-soft">replying to a client &middot; now</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-[85%] bg-surface-2 text-text-soft text-sm leading-relaxed rounded-2xl rounded-bl-[5px] px-4 py-3 mb-3">
        Stuck in a hotel this weekend, only dumbbells in the gym. Can I still get today&rsquo;s
        session in?
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-[86%] ml-auto bg-azure-deep text-white text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed rounded-2xl rounded-br-[5px] px-4 py-3">
        Totally. I&rsquo;ll swap you to today&rsquo;s push day with just dumbbells. Same
        intent, same effort. Sending it over now. Hit me after and tell me how the
        shoulders felt.
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center justify-end gap-2 mt-3 font-label text-xs text-text-soft">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-azure"></span> in their words, on their rules
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3 hero-actions"
      data-reveal
      style="--reveal-delay:280ms"
    >
      <a
        href="#early-access"
        class="hover-button inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-azure-deep hover:bg-azure-deep/90 text-white font-bold text-[15.5px] px-7 py-4 rounded-full"
      >
        Get early access
      </a>
      <a
        href="#how-it-works"
        class="hover-button inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/6 hover:border-azure border border-hairline-dark text-white font-semibold text-[15.5px] px-7 py-4 rounded-full"
      >
        See how it works
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    /* The nav is position:fixed and roughly 73px tall, so it overlays the top
       of this section. The briefed 40px is the space below the nav, not the
       space above the eyebrow in the document. Drop the clearance term to get
       a literal 40px and the eyebrow lands underneath the nav. */
    --hero-nav-clearance: 73px;
    --hero-pad-top: 40px;
    --hero-pad-side: 24px;
    --hero-pad-bottom: 44px;

    padding-top: calc(var(--hero-nav-clearance) + var(--hero-pad-top));
    padding-right: var(--hero-pad-side);
    padding-bottom: var(--hero-pad-bottom);
    padding-left: var(--hero-pad-side);
  }

  /* Azure accent against the dark ground. Peak azure sits at ~22% over ink,
     which keeps white headline text at roughly 15:1, far clear of the 4.5:1
     minimum. */
  .hero-wash {
    background:
      radial-gradient(
        ellipse 115% 78% at 50% 4%,
        rgba(59, 107, 255, 0.22),
        rgba(59, 107, 255, 0.07) 45%,
        transparent 72%
      ),
      radial-gradient(
        ellipse 70% 50% at 50% 100%,
        rgba(59, 107, 255, 0.06),
        transparent 70%
      ),
      var(--color-ink);
  }

  .hero-eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 22px;
  }

  .hero-headline {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 46px;
    line-height: 0.94;
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .hero-subhead {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 270px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    color: #cfd2d7;
  }

  .hero-bubble {
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  /* Proportional scale-up. The mobile baseline above is the briefed setting;
     these only take effect at wider viewports. */
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .hero {
      --hero-pad-top: 56px;
      --hero-pad-side: 32px;
      --hero-pad-bottom: 62px;
    }

    .hero-eyebrow {
      margin-bottom: 26px;
    }

    .hero-headline {
      font-size: clamp(46px, 3.6vw + 32px, 88px);
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .hero-subhead {
      font-size: clamp(15px, 0.35vw + 13.7px, 18px);
      max-width: clamp(270px, 22vw + 187px, 420px);
      margin-bottom: 34px;
    }

    .hero-bubble {
      margin-bottom: 38px;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .hero {
      --hero-pad-top: 72px;
      --hero-pad-side: 40px;
      --hero-pad-bottom: 80px;
    }

    .hero-eyebrow {
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .hero-headline {
      margin-bottom: 27px;
    }

    .hero-subhead {
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .hero-bubble {
      margin-bottom: 44px;
    }
  }
</style>
